#: props/mesh.py:41
msgid "Always face the camera.  The engine replaces this mesh's rotation with the identity, keeping only its position and scale (tsMesh.cc:59).  Build the card standing in the XZ plane -- X becomes screen-right and Z screen-up, so a card lying flat in XY has no height and draws as a smear.  Nothing in the viewport shows this"
msgstr "始终面向摄像机。引擎会把此网格的旋转替换为单位旋转，仅保留其位置和缩放（tsMesh.cc:59）。请把卡片建在 XZ 平面中直立——X 会变成屏幕右方，Z 变成屏幕上方，因此平躺在 XY 平面中的卡片没有高度，会绘制成一条拖影。视口中不会显示这一点"

#: props/material.py:122
msgid "Always write the reflectance as a texture of its own, with its own entry in the shape's material list, even when the export box is on"
msgstr "始终将反射率写为独立纹理，并在形状的材质列表中拥有自己的条目，即使导出复选框已开启"

#: props/material.py:114
msgid "Always write the reflectance map into the diffuse texture's alpha channel and point this material's reflectance slot at itself, even when the export box is off.  That packing is what every material in Tribes 2's own shapes uses"
msgstr "始终将反射率贴图写入漫反射纹理的 Alpha 通道，并让此材质的反射率槽指向自身，即使导出复选框已关闭。Tribes 2 自带形状中的每个材质都使用这种打包方式"

