#: props/decal.py:61
msgid "Cover a face if any of its corners falls inside the projector square.  The most generous rule and the closest to the shipped art"
msgstr "只要面的任一角落入投影器方形内，就覆盖该面。这是最宽松的规则，也最接近随附美术资源"

#: props/decal.py:67
msgid "Cover a face if its centre falls inside the projector square.  Tighter than Any Corner, and it can miss a face larger than the projector"
msgstr "如果面的中心落入投影器方形内，就覆盖该面。比“任一角在内”更严格，且可能漏掉比投影器更大的面"

#: props/decal.py:73
msgid "Cover a face only if all of its corners fall inside the projector square.  Covers nothing on geometry coarser than the decal"
msgstr "仅当面的所有角都落入投影器方形内时才覆盖该面。对于比贴花更粗糙的几何体不会覆盖任何内容"

#: props/decal.py:160
