#: props/decal.py:166
msgid "Do not cover a face whose normal turns further than this from the projector's axis.  90 degrees rejects anything pointing away, which is what stops a decal on the front of a shape also landing on the back.  The original exporter's DECAL::MAX_ANGLE, same default"
msgstr "如果面的法线与投影器轴的偏转超过此值，则不覆盖该面。90 度会拒绝任何背向的面，从而防止形状正面的贴花也落到背面。原导出器的 DECAL::MAX_ANGLE，默认值相同"

