#: props/mesh.py:90
msgid "How deep to partition.  Each level doubles the index buffer, because a subtree is emitted once per direction the walk can arrive from"
msgstr "划分的深度。每增加一级索引缓冲区就翻倍，因为每个子树会按遍历可能到达的每个方向各输出一次"

#: props/decal.py:149
msgid "How far behind the projector a face may sit and still be covered, in multiples of the projector's own half-width.  The format stores no depth axis, so this is a choice rather than a recovered value"
msgstr "面可以位于投影器后方多远仍被覆盖，以投影器自身半宽的倍数计。该格式不存储深度轴，因此这是一个选择值而非可恢复的值"

#: props/material.py:87
msgid "How much of the environment map this material reflects, on top of its reflectance mask.  The engine multiplies the two (tsMesh.cc:1003)"
msgstr "此材质在反射遮罩之外额外反射多少环境贴图。引擎会将两者相乘（tsMesh.cc:1003）"

#: props/material.py:100
msgid "How this material's reflectance map is written on export, when it has one.  Leave it on Follow Export Setting unless this material has to disagree with the rest of the shape"
msgstr "导出时如何写入此材质的反射贴图（若存在）。除非此材质必须与形状其余部分不同，否则保持为跟随导出设置"

