#: ops/import_dts.py:39
msgid "Import each decal as a copy of the faces the file says it covers, one mesh per detail level, instead of as a projector empty.  This is the only way to see the file's own face list, which a projector has to re-derive -- but a decal is exported from a projector, so these meshes reach no file"
msgstr "将每个贴花作为文件所述覆盖面的副本导入，每个细节级别一个网格，而不是作为投影器空物体。这是查看文件自身面列表的唯一方式，投影器必须重新推导——但贴花是从投影器导出的，因此这些网格不会写入任何文件"

#: ops/import_dts.py:50
msgid "Import every LOD, not just the one the engine shows by default.  They all stand at the same origin, so a shape with eleven levels imports as eleven overlapping copies.  Collision and LOS details are kept either way; the levels left out lose their geometry in anything exported from this scene"
msgstr "导入所有 LOD，而不仅是引擎默认显示的那一个。它们都位于同一原点，因此有十一个级别的形状会导入为十一个重叠副本。碰撞和 LOS 细节无论如何都会保留；被省略的级别在从此场景导出的任何内容中都会丢失几何体"

