#: props/mesh.py:74
msgid "Repeat the mesh type in the low three bits of the flags word.  Whether an exporter did this varies per mesh -- every sorted mesh in the corpus does, and 16 of its 20 skins -- so it is recorded rather than inferred"
msgstr "在标志字的低三位中重复网格类型。不同网格的导出器是否这样做各不相同——语料库中的每个已排序网格都这样做，其 20 个蒙皮中有 16 个也这样做——因此将其记录而不是推断"

#: ops/export_dts.py:90
msgid "Resize exported textures to the nearest power-of-two dimensions (100x60 becomes 128x64).  Torque's texture loader assumes power-of-two sizes, so one that is not renders white or garbled in-game while looking correct in Blender.  Only the written file is resized -- the image in your .blend is left alone"
msgstr "将导出的纹理调整为最接近的 2 的幂尺寸（100x60 变为 128x64）。Torque 的纹理加载器假定尺寸为 2 的幂，因此非 2 的幂的纹理在游戏中会渲染成白色或乱码，而在 Blender 中看起来正常。仅调整写入的文件——.blend 中的图像保持不变"

#: props/node.py:33
msgid "Rest Rotation (raw)"
msgstr "静止旋转（原始）"

#: props/node.py:39
msgid "Rest Translation"
msgstr "静止平移"

#: ui/panels.py:525
msgid "Root motion: what gives a movement animation its speed"
msgstr "根运动：为移动动画提供速度的因素"

#: props/sequence.py:52
