msgstr "缩放模式"

#: ops/export_dts.py:90
msgid "Scale Textures to Power of Two"
msgstr "将纹理缩放为 2 的幂"

#: ops/export_dts.py:99
msgid "Scale any exported texture larger than 512x512 down to fit, keeping its aspect ratio.  An oversized texture still renders, but the engine uploads and mipmaps all of it and the driver resamples what its hardware cannot hold, so the size is paid for and then discarded.  512 is the largest the art this format ships with is built to.  Only the written file is resized -- the image in your .blend is left alone"
msgstr "将任何大于 512x512 的导出纹理按比例缩小以适配。过大的纹理仍能渲染，但引擎会将其全部上传并生成 mipmap，而驱动会重采样其硬件无法容纳的部分，因此尺寸代价付出了却被丢弃。512 是该格式附带的美术资源所支持的最大尺寸。仅调整写入的文件——.blend 中的图像保持不变"

#: props/scene.py:46
msgid "Scales every material's reflection, the way the engine's shape-level environment-map alpha does.  The game uses 1.0; the SDK shape viewer makes it a slider.  Preview only"
msgstr "缩放每个材质的反射，方式与引擎的形体级环境贴图 alpha 相同。游戏使用 1.0；SDK 形体查看器将其做成滑块。仅预览"

