#: props/decal.py:104
msgid "The decal's name in the file.  Not unique -- turret_tank_base gives all fourteen of its decals the same one -- so the index below is its identity"
msgstr "文件中此贴花的名称。不唯一——turret_tank_base 的十四个贴花全都用同一个名称——因此下面的索引才是它的标识"

#: ui/operators.py:136
