msgstr "贴花的名称。真实形体中不唯一；索引才是它的标识"

#: props/decal.py:140
msgid "The decal's own material, which is not the target's.  It had nowhere to live once the decal stopped being a mesh with a material slot"
msgstr "贴花自身的材质，并非目标的材质。贴花不再是带材质槽的网格后，它便无处存放"

#: ui/panels.py:474
msgid "The engine takes it from the mission sky's .dml"
msgstr "引擎从任务天空的 .dml 中获取"

#: props/decal.py:112
msgid "The file's own identity for this decal.  decal_states[i] and each sequence's decal_matters bits are keyed by it, so two decals must not share one"
msgstr "文件为此外贴花自身的标识。decal_states[i] 和每个序列的 decal_matters 位都以它为键，因此两个贴花不能共用同一个"

#: ops/export_dts.py:37
msgid "The flat-stream format: no mesh bounds (the engine computes them), no vertex sharing between detail levels, no merge indices, no LOD error metrics, and no decal projection planes"
msgstr "扁平流格式：没有网格边界（由引擎计算），细节层级之间没有顶点共享，没有合并索引，没有 LOD 误差度量，也没有贴花投影平面"

#: ops/export_dts.py:27
msgid "The format Tribes 2's own shapes use.  No ground frames -- v23 and v22 have nowhere for them"
msgstr "Tribes 2 自带形体使用的格式。没有地面帧——v23 和 v22 无处存放它们"

#: ui/panels.py:424
msgid "The mask comes from the node graph"
msgstr "遮罩来自节点图"

#: ui/panels.py:419
msgid "The mask is this texture's alpha, shared with transparency"
msgstr "遮罩是此纹理的 alpha，与透明度共用"

#: props/decal.py:129
msgid "The mesh this decal projects onto.  A pointer and not a name: export matches the decal's faces against this exact object's vertices, and a renamed mesh used to silently cover nothing"
msgstr "此贴花投射到的网格。它是指针而非名称：导出时将贴花的面与此确切物体的顶点匹配，而重命名过的网格以前会静默地不覆盖任何东西"

#: ops/export_dts.py:43
msgid "The oldest this add-on writes.  As v16, and meshes are indexed through a separate list rather than a null-mesh marker"
msgstr "此插件可写入的最旧格式。作为 v16，网格通过单独列表索引，而不是空网格标记"

#: props/scene.py:36
msgid "The sphere map reflective materials show, standing in for the sky the engine would take it from.  Preview only -- it is not part of the shape and is never exported.  With none set, nothing reflects"
msgstr "反射材质所显示的球面贴图，用来代替引擎原本会从中获取的天空。仅预览——它不属于形体，且从不导出。未设置时，不反射任何内容"

#: props/material.py:65
msgid "This material is an animated flipbook: the engine reads a .ifl file named after it and swaps the texture as the sequence runs.  Ticking this is what puts an entry in the shape's IFL table, and export writes the frames below out as that .ifl"
msgstr "此材质是动画翻页图集：引擎会读取与其同名的 .ifl 文件，并在序列播放时切换纹理。勾选此项会把一条记录写入形体的 IFL 表，导出时会将下方的帧写出为该 .ifl"

#: props/sequence.py:36
msgid "Three factors per keyframe, along the node's own axes"
msgstr "每个关键帧三个因子，沿节点自身的坐标轴"

