#: ops/export_dts.py:58
msgid "Write a .png beside the .dts for every texture the shape names, whether it was made in Blender or loaded from disk.  Existing files are overwritten, so exporting into a game's textures/ tree rewrites the art there.  A material's .ifl is written either way -- it is animation data, not art"
msgstr "为形体引用的每个纹理在 .dts 旁写出一个 .png，无论它是在 Blender 中生成的还是从磁盘加载的。已存在的文件会被覆盖，因此导出到游戏的 textures/ 目录会重写那里的美术资源。材质的 .ifl 无论如何都会写出——它是动画数据，不是美术资源"

#: props/mesh.py:100
msgid "Write depth values even where the mesh is translucent"
msgstr "即使网格为半透明也写入深度值"

#: ops/export_dts.py:67
msgid "Write each decal as an ordinary mesh object -- the faces it covers, copied, lifted just off the surface so the two do not z-fight, with the projection baked into its UVs -- instead of as a TSDecalMesh.  Anything that reads a .dts then draws the decal, including tools that skip the decal section, and the shape no longer needs a translucent mesh to draw decals against.  The file carries no decal entries afterwards, so re-importing gives meshes and no projectors"
msgstr "将每个贴花写为普通网格物体——复制其覆盖的面，略微抬离表面以免两者发生 z-fighting，并把投影烘焙进其 UV——而不是写成 TSDecalMesh。任何读取 .dts 的程序都会绘制该贴花，包括跳过贴花段的工具，且形体不再需要半透明网格来绘制贴花。之后文件中不再包含贴花条目，因此重新导入只会得到网格而没有投影器"

#: ops/export_dts.py:79
msgid "Write each material's reflectance map into its diffuse texture's alpha channel, so the shape names one texture and points its reflectance slot at itself.  That is the packing every material in Tribes 2's own shapes uses.  Unchecked, the diffuse and the reflectance are written as separate files and the reflectance gets its own entry in the material list.  A material set to Combine or Separate in its DTS Material panel overrules this for itself"
msgstr "将每个材质的反射率贴图写入其漫反射纹理的 alpha 通道，这样形体只引用一个纹理，并让反射率槽指向自身。这是 Tribes 2 自带形体的每个材质都采用的打包方式。取消勾选时，漫反射与反射率会写成各自独立的文件，反射率在材质列表中获得自己的条目。在 DTS 材质面板中设为「合并」或「分离」的材质会覆盖此设置"

